        "TileImage": "$($repository c8c6979e-2b8b-48cc-b405-7f1138b88e8c).Image",
        "Description": "Our client is Alma Reynard. She suspects our targets to be potential Providence moles. Against her the wishes of her boss, Lucas Grey, she wants them dealt with immediately.  Sneak onto the roof and take out the targets with your best sniper rifle and then quietly escape.\r\rAlso, Lucas just found out about this contract. He said Reynard is so fired after this. Good luck 47.",
